792283109","text":"CC: @leungbk Remove unsafe dir-locals config from .dir-locals.el Hi, thanks for develop/maintaining such a great project! I found your .dir-locals include unsafe config. This eval feature has a LAR...","thumb_url":"https://repository-images.githubusercontent.com/75415169/61c25480-93b5-11e9-9b4b-3161cebdb7fb","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":773,"thumb_height":250,"from_url":"https://github.com/emacs-lsp/lsp-mode/pull/2689#issuecomment-792283109","original_url":"https://github.com/emacs-lsp/lsp-mode/pull/2689#issuecomment-792283109"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6TsR/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e84f656b-cbb3-44fd-91e9-9d381eee9e12","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u0026gt; 自分の設定を入れたら差分が出てしまうのもウザい\nこれはEmacsで謎機能があって.dir-locals-2.elというファイルは個人設定用に用意されてるんですよね。。\n\u003chttps://ayatakesi.github.io/emacs/26.2/html/Directory-Variables.html\u003e","ts":"1615125312.119000","attachments":[{"fallback":"GNU Emacs Manual (Japanese Translation): Directory Variables","id":1,"title":"GNU Emacs Manual (Japanese Translation): Directory Variables","title_link":"https://ayatakesi.github.io/emacs/26.2/html/Directory-Variables.html","text":"GNU Emacs Manual (Japanese Translation): Directory Variables","blocks":null,"service_name":"ayatakesi.github.io","from_url":"https://ayatakesi.github.io/emacs/26.2/html/Directory-Variables.html","original_url":"https://ayatakesi.github.io/emacs/26.2/html/Directory-Variables.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qeW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D9A7268A-97C7-411A-8688-350453B0DC9A","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":".envrcをコミットする派と、.envrc.exampleだけコミットしてコピーして利用させる派みたいなもんか。\n個人的には後者で、理由はパーソナルなファイルだからですね。\n.dir-locals.elも同様で僕にとってはパーソナルなファイルなので、プロジェクトで配置して欲しくないし、コミットされているせいで、自分の設定を入れたら差分が出てしまうのもウザい。","ts":"1615125227.117600","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1615125267.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PVm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01f7c31b-46ea-4399-81a8-d73951c5ea8f","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"そのうち ! が自動で適応されるよと書いてあるのが怖さを増幅する(このパッケージが安全か否かはここでは置いておく)","ts":"1615124755.112400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1dJdL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c3b1602-c74e-4405-bf8f-cbb8f9047066","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"何も知らない人は警告見ずに、ただ !(永続許可) しちゃうんですよね。。","ts":"1615124527.111100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B7kb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11406a2d-402b-4d0d-ab73-d52b5ffd7e92","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"まあ「何も知らない人に対しても警告出してくれるから安全だよね」ということなんだと思いますが。たしかにムムム、とはなりますね…","ts":"1615124482.110900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TzPiG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b5c64d1-2686-4ea9-894c-7fcd425a749a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"というわけでこの方法でインデントスタイルを変えようというのがそもそも間違い。","ts":"1615124467.110500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=JnS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51a8c31f-8107-4ddc-819d-8e5869598dc7","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"先方からevalだけを無効化する方法を教えてもらったのでこれでやろうかなとも思ってるんですが、これで書いたパッチはインデント狂ってるわけで、それでいいの？という。。","ts":"1615124394.109900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KfYGU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a20650a-24e4-4bd2-a4a4-57772b122bee","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"気になる人がグローバルに無効化すればいいじゃん、は反論になってない気が…\n何も知らない人が無意識にクローンしてそのディレクトリ上でファイルを開いたらセキュリティ上リスクがある、という話をしているのであって、「気になる人」がどう設定しようが関係ない話","ts":"1615124343.109300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LN7e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58e71187-0623-4608-b480-5ba95b8fc651","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"個人的にはコードスタイルごときのためにevalなど使うな派","ts":"1615124301.108400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3CO"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ただ警告画面がこれなので、これで絶対安全かどうかを確認するのはちょっと。。\nそもそもそんなの置かないでくれで良い気もしますけどね。。","ts":"1615124278.107500","files":[{"id":"F01R4UN4LD6","created":1615124273,"timestamp":1615124273,"name":"Screenshot_2021-03-07_21-20-22.png","title":"Screenshot_2021-03-07_21-20-22.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":233983,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F01R4UN4LD6/screenshot_2021-03-07_21-20-22.png","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F01R4UN4LD6/download/screenshot_2021-03-07_21-20-22.png","original_h":1261,"original_w":664,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01R4UN4LD6-79fdbd4860/screenshot_2021-03-07_21-20-22_64.png","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01R4UN4LD6-79fdbd4860/screenshot_2021-03-07_21-20-22_80.png","thumb_160":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01R4UN4LD6-79fdbd4860/screenshot_2021-03-07_21-20-22_160.png","thumb_360":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01R4UN4LD6-79fdbd4860/screenshot_2021-03-07_21-20-22_360.png","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":190,"thumb_360_h":360,"thumb_480":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01R4UN4LD6-79fdbd4860/screenshot_2021-03-07_21-20-22_480.png","thumb_480_w":253,"thumb_480_h":480,"thumb_720":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01R4UN4LD6-79fdbd4860/screenshot_2021-03-07_21-20-22_720.png","thumb_720_w":379,"thumb_720_h":720,"thumb_960":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01R4UN4LD6-79fdbd4860/screenshot_2021-03-07_21-20-22_960.png","thumb_960_w":506,"thumb_960_h":960,"thumb_1024":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01R4UN4LD6-79fdbd4860/screenshot_2021-03-07_21-20-22_1024.png","thumb_1024_w":539,"thumb_1024_h":1024,"permalink":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/files/UDPT2BZ6E/F01R4UN4LD6/screenshot_2021-03-07_21-20-22.png","permalink_public":"https://slack-files.com/T03C4RC8V-F01R4UN4LD6-aa6e6fc3f7","edit_link":"","preview":"","preview_highlight":"","lines":0,"lines_more":0,"is_public":true,"public_url_shared":false,"channels":null,"groups":null,"ims":null,"initial_comment":{},"comments_count":0,"num_stars":0,"is_starred":false,"shares":{"public":null,"private":null},"display_as_bot":false,"has_rich_preview":false,"thumb_800":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01R4UN4LD6-79fdbd4860/screenshot_2021-03-07_21-20-22_800.png","thumb_800_h":800,"thumb_800_w":421,"thumb_tiny":"AwAwABmpgH0pCPpTqKAGYop+KSgBaKKKACiiigAopM+1G72oAWkpMmjJoA//2Q==","username":""}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jr63"}]},{"client_msg_id":"462175ab-535c-46cb-8aa2-d422d4349856","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"そこの認識はこのissueで少しアップデートがあって、永続許可はファイルパスだけ記録されると思っていたのですが、S式も記録されるとのことなので、dir-localsに変更があるともう一度警告が出ることが分かりました。","ts":"1615124205.107000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+2oj/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1cc8611-a636-4dd3-9c08-8cc8501c3ccf","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そもそもこの問題の本質はここでevalを許可することで、他のファイルに存在するevalが警告されなくなるってことでOK?","ts":"1615124036.106500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TvQI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c706bcf3-2011-4caa-b9b5-3867c16f1a5a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なぜグローバルに無効化しないといけないのかと聞いたら、それは例外設定ができないのが悪いのでEmacs本家に言ってくれとのこと。\nそれはそうな気がするけど、そうでもない気がする？？","ts":"1615123814.105900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ye9w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29abefd5-ea76-4e3e-b4b3-30470a048f50","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"そうなんですよね。普通はそんなことしないんですが、たまに置いてるところがあります。\n(他の例はsmartparens \u003chttps://github.com/Fuco1/smartparens/blob/master/smartparens.el#L9641\u003e\n これはdir-localsではないですが、このファイルだけで有効なeval句。ファイルを開くと自動実行される)\nおっこれは便利な機能だ!って思ったときにちょっとセキュリティのことを考えて欲しいですよね。。","ts":"1615123575.105600","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: Fuco1/smartparens","id":1,"title":"Fuco1/smartparens","title_link":"https://github.com/Fuco1/smartparens/blob/master/smartparens.el#L9641","text":"Minor mode for Emacs that deals with parens pairs and tries to be smart about it. - Fuco1/smartparens","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2664959?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/Fuco1/smartparens/blob/master/smartparens.el#L9641","original_url":"https://github.com/Fuco1/smartparens/blob/master/smartparens.el#L9641"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ChW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd68450a-bf29-461c-96c7-d84198268a7b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"lsp-mode、だめでは","ts":"1615123227.105300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h2Bh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e603580e-59ae-40fe-90c9-4bfea583d02d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そもそもプラグインがそんなもの置くべきではないと思ってるんですが、共通認識ではないの？","ts":"1615123216.105100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RSJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cfb9a8a3-b345-4f95-80da-78f96f868062","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"dir-localsをグローバルに無効化すればいいじゃんってコメントされた。。\nなんでlsp-modeプロジェクトが危険なdir-localsを置いているせいで私のdir-localsの機能をグローバルに無効にしないといけないのか。","ts":"1615123136.104700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4O=SS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb2be467-c452-4390-81a5-8a919140db1b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"flycheckというリアルタイムに警告を出す機能もあるんですが、これもリアルタイムにバッファをバイトコンパイルするので、ファイルを開くだけで任意のElispを実行させることができる。","ts":"1615122153.104200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7iC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe50cd09-2304-421d-a248-7891bea85744","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"パッケージインストールは脆弱なんですよね。パッケージインストールに付随するバイトコンパイル中に任意のElispが実行できる機能がある。","ts":"1615122147.103800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j6uG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1bf9b14-d554-4ed9-8d81-52a08b5e1f2b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"最近にもVim scriptが悪用された話があるし","ts":"1615121925.103500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3=t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22e1584b-b277-41ee-95f9-38e4e057b714","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"セキュリティー問題だ","ts":"1615121911.102900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9BcN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34a2c751-dd11-4d05-b43b-4658af564591","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"どうやら ! (永続許可) は許可を出したS式を覚えておいて、そのS式が変わるとまた警告を出してくれるらしいです。\nただ、そんな挙動は知る必要がないし、やはりファイルを開いた瞬間に任意の式が実行できるというのは本質的に間違ってる気がします。","ts":"1615121040.102600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N=w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5c2fff8-f137-4a66-84b5-19945475a822","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"localrcはプラグイン入れてやってるけど、標準でやるのはやめてほしい","ts":"1615120758.102400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QDsvs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df09c608-7174-4a0c-a760-c78720fddab2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"あー、ヤバい","ts":"1615120649.101600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jxh7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da0a3559-4e0e-4ac5-9648-08a38e48152e","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Vim でいう以下のハックみたいなものですかね。 emacs では標準であるんですね\n\u003chttps://vim-jp.org/vim-users-jp/2009/12/27/Hack-112.html\u003e","ts":"1615120386.101400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N5IC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76e08efb-3c47-4cef-9b29-acfb083bd127","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ちなみに解説するとEmacsは .dir-locals.el というファイルで、そのフォルダの配下のファイルを編集するときのEmacsの設定を\"多少\"変更することができます。\nこれは変数を変更するだけでなく、このように「Elisp式を実行」することもできます。\nしかしこれはとても危険なので、削除して欲しいと頼んだところです。\n(ファイルを開くだけで変なサーバーに ~/.ssh を全部送信するとかも簡単にできる)","ts":"1615120203.100900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y4Fu9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8106cc9-912a-4523-a57e-1afa3fcb7161","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"lsp-modeのdir-locals.elに苦言を呈した。これ、本当に止めて欲しい。これだけでコントリビュートする気無くする。\n\u003chttps://github.com/emacs-lsp/lsp-mode/pull/2689\u003e","ts":"1615120028.100600","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: Remove unsafe dir-locals config from .dir-locals.el by conao3 · Pull Request #2689 · emacs-lsp/lsp-mode","id":1,"title":"Remove unsafe dir-locals config from .dir-locals.el by conao3 · Pull Request #2689 · emacs-lsp/lsp-mode","title_link":"https://github.com/emacs-lsp/lsp-mode/pull/2689","text":"CC: @leungbk Remove unsafe dir-locals config from .dir-locals.el Hi, thanks for develop/maintaining such a great project! I found your .dir-locals include unsafe config. This eval feature has a LAR...","thumb_url":"https://repository-images.githubusercontent.com/75415169/61c25480-93b5-11e9-9b4b-3161cebdb7fb","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":773,"thumb_height":250,"from_url":"https://github.com/emacs-lsp/lsp-mode/pull/2689","original_url":"https://github.com/emacs-lsp/lsp-mode/pull/2689"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7mMEa"}]}]
